<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄση</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, 
			Aeol.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσα,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>surfeit, loathing, nausea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.61
			</span></i> (pl.), <i>Acut.(Sp.</i>)<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄση περὶ τὴν καρδίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epid.</u>
					7.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. πλησμονή</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				221 xi 18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>distress, vexation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.136
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Andronic.Rhod.
				p.570
			</span></i> M.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπαυσε καρδίαν ἄσης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					245
				</span></i>
			: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή μ᾽ ἄσαισι μήτ᾽ ὀνίαισι δάμνα
					θῦμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				14.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύπας καὶ ἄσας παρέχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					71c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.100
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>longing, desire,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆρ ἄσᾳ βόρηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					25.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				3.433
			</span></i>. (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄω</span>
			<i>satiate.</i>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
